---
// Form Scoring component
---
<section id="rep-scoring" class="section-pad" style="max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;padding:112px 32px 0">
  <div class="form-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:.95fr 1.05fr;gap:60px;align-items:center">
    <div style="display:flex;justify-content:center;position:relative">
      <div style="position:relative;width:262px;height:534px;border-radius:42px;background:#000;padding:9px;box-shadow:0 40px 80px -32px rgba(0,0,0,.8), inset 0 0 0 1.5px rgba(255,255,255,.12)">
        <div style="width:100%;height:100%;border-radius:34px;background:#0B0E11;overflow:hidden;padding:40px 18px 18px;display:flex;flex-direction:column">
          <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between">
            <div>
              <div style="font-size:11px;font-weight:500;color:#AAEC58">Nice work</div>
              <div style="font-size:18px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.01em;line-height:1.05">18 reps · 4:02</div>
            </div>
            <div style="font:700 20px 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;color:#AAEC58">8.8</div>
          </div>
          <div style="margin-top:14px;border-radius:20px;background:#AAEC58;color:#0B0E11;padding:16px 16px 15px">
            <div style="font-size:9.5px;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.09em;opacity:.65">Your one cue for next time</div>
            <div style="margin-top:6px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.26;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.01em">Keep your elbows closer to your ribs on the way down.</div>
            <div style="margin-top:11px;display:inline-flex;padding:5px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(11,14,17,.12);font-size:10px;font-weight:600">Focus cue · Elbow tuck</div>
          </div>
          <div style="margin-top:16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:11px">
            <div>
              <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:500">
                <span>Depth</span>
                <span style="color:#AAEC58;font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif">8.0</span>
              </div>
              <div style="height:7px;border-radius:4px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);margin-top:5px">
                <div style="width:80%;height:100%;border-radius:4px;background:#AAEC58"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:500">
                <span>Elbow tuck</span>
                <span style="color:#AAEC58;font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif">7.4</span>
              </div>
              <div style="height:7px;border-radius:4px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);margin-top:5px">
                <div style="width:74%;height:100%;border-radius:4px;background:#AAEC58"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:500">
                <span>Tempo</span>
                <span style="color:#AAEC58;font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif">8.8</span>
              </div>
              <div style="height:7px;border-radius:4px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);margin-top:5px">
                <div style="width:88%;height:100%;border-radius:4px;background:#AAEC58"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div style="flex:1"></div>
          <div style="height:48px;border-radius:15px;background:#AAEC58;color:#0B0E11;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer">Done</div>
          <div style="margin-top:10px;text-align:center;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;color:#AAEC58;cursor:pointer">Start another set</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div style="font-size:11.5px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#AAEC58">Rep scoring</div>
      <h2 class="section-title" style="margin:14px 0 0;font-size:40px;line-height:1.1;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.028em">One cue, not a report card.</h2>
      <p style="margin:18px 0 0;max-width:460px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:rgba(242,244,245,.65)">
        After the set, LeanReps scores every rep on three things and then tells you the single most useful correction for next time. You can open the rep-by-rep breakdown when you want the detail.
      </p>
      <div style="margin-top:30px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;max-width:440px">
        <div style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start">
          <span style="width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:999px;background:#AAEC58;flex:none;margin-top:7px"></span>
          <div>
            <div style="font-size:15px;font-weight:600">Depth</div>
            <div style="font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.5;color:#8b99b0">Whether you're reaching a full range of motion on each rep.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start">
          <span style="width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:999px;background:#AAEC58;flex:none;margin-top:7px"></span>
          <div>
            <div style="font-size:15px;font-weight:600">Elbow tuck</div>
            <div style="font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.5;color:#8b99b0">How close your elbows stay to your ribs on the descent.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start">
          <span style="width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:999px;background:#AAEC58;flex:none;margin-top:7px"></span>
          <div>
            <div style="font-size:15px;font-weight:600">Tempo</div>
            <div style="font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.5;color:#8b99b0">Whether your pace holds steady as you fatigue.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
